CRITICAL TOOL CALLING FORMAT:
You MUST NEVER output tool calls as JSON like {"name": "...", "arguments": ...}.
You MUST format tool calls strictly using Cline's XML tags:

To read a file:
<read_file>
<path>relative/path/to/file</path>
</read_file>

To create or overwrite a file:
<write_to_file>
<path>relative/path/to/file</path>
<content>
file contents here
</content>
</write_to_file>

To run a terminal command:
<execute_command>
<command>cmake --build build</command>
</execute_command>

Execute only ONE tool at a time and wait for the tool output before continuing.